[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10560.55, "timestamp": "02:56:00", "text": "抽搐？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10573.19, "timestamp": "02:56:13", "text": "一个小宇宙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10575.59, "timestamp": "02:56:15", "text": "杰克，我遇到技术问题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10578.87, "timestamp": "02:56:18", "text": "困难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10582.55, "timestamp": "02:56:22", "text": "呃，因为我现在正在同时进行多个应用。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10585.11, "timestamp": "02:56:25", "text": "所以你认为问题会是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10587.51, "timestamp": "02:56:27", "text": "因为我的Twitch直播是……所以我没办法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10589.269, "timestamp": "02:56:29", "text": "不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10591.59, "timestamp": "02:56:31", "text": "呃，我要在Twitch上直播了，但我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10594.63, "timestamp": "02:56:34", "text": "YouTube直播。你能帮帮我吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10602.23, "timestamp": "02:56:42", "text": "啊，这个问题是已知问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10604.309, "timestamp": "02:56:44", "text": "是的，有时候连我也会这样，还有其他的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10606.15, "timestamp": "02:56:46", "text": "朋友们都有，而且是在流媒体播放的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10608.79, "timestamp": "02:56:48", "text": "软件或 OBS 突然无法串流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10611.19, "timestamp": "02:56:51", "text": "Twitch 将离线，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10613.11, "timestamp": "02:56:53", "text": "YouTube 将会上线。在这种情况下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10615.59, "timestamp": "02:56:55", "text": "重启 OBS 即可解决此问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10619.83, "timestamp": "02:56:59", "text": "你应该在所有平台上进行直播。"}]